From: UN1CA <unica@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] Enable SUPPORT_A2DP_SBM on the One UI 9 constructor ABI

Only the SBM capability argument changes; keep the new profile/codec ABI.

diff --git a/smali/com/android/bluetooth/a2dp/A2dpService.smali b/smali/com/android/bluetooth/a2dp/A2dpService.smali
--- a/smali/com/android/bluetooth/a2dp/A2dpService.smali
+++ b/smali/com/android/bluetooth/a2dp/A2dpService.smali
@@ -886,8 +886,10 @@
 
     invoke-virtual {p0}, Lcom/android/bluetooth/profile/ProfileService;->getAdapterService()Lcom/android/bluetooth/btservice/AdapterService;
 
     move-result-object p4
 
+    const/4 p1, 0x1
+
     invoke-direct {p2, p1, p3, p4}, Lcom/android/bluetooth/a2dp/A2dpSbmManager;-><init>(ZLandroid/media/AudioManager;Lcom/android/bluetooth/btservice/AdapterService;)V
 
     iput-object p2, p0, Lcom/android/bluetooth/a2dp/A2dpService;->mA2dpSbmManager:Lcom/android/bluetooth/a2dp/A2dpSbmManager;
